OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPCs 'lost control' with amputee,
OL,4,A92, in care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2025 both officers were
OL,7,Facquitted of assault occasioning actual
OL,8,Fbodily harm, where it was shown Smith
OL,9,Fused incapacitating Pava spray and a
OL,10,Fbaton on Donald Burgess, while Comotto
OL,11,Fdeployed her Taser.
OL,13,FOpening the case, Aaron Rathmell, the
OL,14,Fforce's lawyer, said the "officers
OL,15,Facted, hastily, harshly and lost
OL,16,Fcontrol".
